---
import InternalLayout from '../../../layouts/InternalLayout.astro';
---
<InternalLayout title="Internal tools">
  <div class="tools-head"><div><p class="kicker">Clearview internal</p><h1>Tools</h1><p class="lede">Field, sales, CRM, and operations utilities built around the way Clearview actually works.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/internal/quotes/new">New quote</a></div>

  <section class="mail-test panel" aria-labelledby="mail-test-title">
    <div class="mail-test-copy"><p class="kicker">Production check</p><h2 id="mail-test-title">Estimate email delivery</h2><p>Run a controlled message through the same Resend configuration used by the public estimate form. This does not create a customer lead.</p></div>
    <div class="mail-test-action"><div class="mail-test-buttons"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-mail-test>Send production test</button><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-mail-check>Check Resend activity</button></div><p class="mail-test-status" data-mail-status role="status">No test run yet.</p></div>
    <div class="mail-test-results" data-mail-results hidden><div class="mail-result-block"><p class="kicker">Recent Resend sends</p><div data-mail-sends></div></div><div class="mail-result-block"><p class="kicker">Sending domains</p><div data-mail-domains></div></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="app-card panel" aria-labelledby="app-title" data-app-card>
    <div class="app-copy">
      <p class="kicker">Phone app</p>
      <h2 id="app-title">Install and offline</h2>
      <p>Install the Command Center on your home screen so it opens full screen, and keep Today, Jobs and Field mode usable with no signal. While you are signed in, the main pages, follow-ups and each active job (including what Field mode reads) are saved on this phone automatically, for up to 3 days, and refreshed whenever you have a signal.</p>
      <p class="app-limits"><strong>Needs a connection:</strong> saving checklists, evidence, approvals, quotes, invoices and payments. Nothing is queued to run later. <strong>Works offline:</strong> viewing saved pages and data, and taking job photos (stored on this phone).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="app-panel">
      <ul class="app-status" data-app-status aria-live="polite"><li>Checking this phone…</li></ul>
      <div class="app-ios" data-app-ios hidden>
        <strong>On iPhone or iPad:</strong> in Safari tap <b>Share</b>, then <b>Add to Home Screen</b>. The installed app has its own storage and sign-in: it will ask for the password once, and photos taken in Safari will not appear in it. <span data-app-photo-count></span>
      </div>
      <div class="app-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-app-install hidden>Install app</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-app-update>Check for updates</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-app-refresh>Save pages for offline</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-app-clear>Clear saved data</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-app-diag>Copy diagnostics</button>
      </div>
      <textarea class="app-diag" data-app-diag-text readonly rows="8" aria-label="Diagnostics" hidden></textarea>
      <p class="app-note" data-app-note role="status"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tool-grid" aria-label="Internal tools">
    <a class="tool-card tool-primary" href="/internal/tools/measurements"><span class="tool-icon">⌗</span><div><p class="kicker">Field</p><h2>Window measurements</h2><p>Capture openings, dimensions, quantities, rooms, replacement method, and notes from the job site.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card tool-primary visualizer-card" href="/internal/quotes"><span class="tool-icon">◈</span><div><p class="kicker">Production</p><h2>Build plan + visualizer</h2><p>Build the plan opening-by-opening, then switch to a visual field map that walks Mark through scope, openings, materials, installation, and QC.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open quotes →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card tool-primary field-mode-card" href="/internal/jobs"><span class="tool-icon">▶</span><div><p class="kicker">Field execution</p><h2>Opening field mode</h2><p>Open a job and execute one opening at a time through Verify, Remove, Prep, Install, Flash / Seal, Operate, Photograph, and Complete.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Choose a job →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/quotes/new"><span class="tool-icon">$</span><div><p class="kicker">Sales</p><h2>Smart quote builder</h2><p>Build an editable quote from the price book, add custom work, and finalize or print.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open quote builder →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/follow-up"><span class="tool-icon">↗</span><div><p class="kicker">CRM</p><h2>Lead follow-up</h2><p>Turn a lead into a concrete next action with due dates, contact shortcuts, notes, and completion tracking.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open follow-up →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/jobs"><span class="tool-icon">✓</span><div><p class="kicker">Operations</p><h2>Job workspace</h2><p>Turn finalized quotes into projects, schedule installation, track progress, and keep crew notes with the job.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open jobs →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/jobs"><span class="tool-icon">▣</span><div><p class="kicker">Operations</p><h2>Job prep & closeout</h2><p>Open a job first, then launch its field checklist, quote-material review, staging notes, and closeout workflow.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Choose a job →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/payments"><span class="tool-icon">◫</span><div><p class="kicker">Closeout</p><h2>Payments & balances</h2><p>Record payment-to-date, see outstanding balances, and reconcile job-level collections internally.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open payments →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/schedule"><span class="tool-icon">□</span><div><p class="kicker">Operations</p><h2>Installation schedule</h2><p>See scheduled projects by week and jump directly into the job workspace.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open schedule →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/tools/photos"><span class="tool-icon">▧</span><div><p class="kicker">Field</p><h2>Installation photos</h2><p>Capture before, during, after, and issue photos with job IDs, timestamps, and field notes.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Open photo log →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/leads"><span class="tool-icon">◌</span><div><p class="kicker">CRM</p><h2>Lead workspace</h2><p>Review inbound requests, contact details, attribution, and visitor journeys.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Work leads →</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/internal/ask-logs"><span class="tool-icon">✦</span><div><p class="kicker">Intelligence</p><h2>Ask activity</h2><p>See what prospects are asking the Clearview website assistant before they contact the company.</p></div><span class="tool-arrow">Review Ask →</span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="roadmap panel"><div><p class="kicker">Operating sequence</p><h2>From estimate to completed job</h2><p class="muted">The internal system is built around one continuous record instead of separate disconnected utilities.</p></div><div class="roadmap-flow" aria-label="Workflow roadmap"><span>Lead</span><i>→</i><span>Measure</span><i>→</i><span>Quote</span><i>→</i><span>Build plan</span><i>→</i><span>Visualize</span><i>→</i><span>Sign</span><i>→</i><span>Schedule</span><i>→</i><span>Prep</span><i>→</i><span>Field mode</span><i>→</i><span>Close</span><i>→</i><span>Collect</span></div></section>
</InternalLayout>
<script>
  import { buildDiagnostics, buildLabel, checkForUpdate, clearSavedData, formatAge, getPhotoBackup, getPwaStatus, onPwaChange, promptInstall, warmPages } from '../../../scripts/internal-pwa';
  import { photoBackupLine } from '../../../lib/pwa-logic';
  import { countStoredPhotos } from '../../../lib/field-photo-db';

  function initAppCard() {
    const card = document.querySelector('[data-app-card]');
    if (!(card instanceof HTMLElement) || card.dataset.bound === 'true') return;
    card.dataset.bound = 'true';
    const list = card.querySelector('[data-app-status]') as HTMLElement;
    const ios = card.querySelector('[data-app-ios]') as HTMLElement;
    const photoCount = card.querySelector('[data-app-photo-count]') as HTMLElement;
    const install = card.querySelector('[data-app-install]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const refresh = card.querySelector('[data-app-refresh]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const clear = card.querySelector('[data-app-clear]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const update = card.querySelector('[data-app-update]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const diag = card.querySelector('[data-app-diag]') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const diagText = card.querySelector('[data-app-diag-text]') as HTMLTextAreaElement;
    const note = card.querySelector('[data-app-note]') as HTMLElement;

    async function render() {
      const s = await getPwaStatus();
      const rows: string[] = [];
      const row = (ok: boolean | null, label: string) => rows.push(`<li data-state="${ok === null ? 'unknown' : ok ? 'ok' : 'no'}">${label}</li>`);
      row(s.standalone, s.standalone ? 'Running as an installed app' : 'Running in the browser (not installed)');
      row(s.supported && s.controlled, !s.supported ? 'Offline support is not available in this browser' : s.controlled ? 'Offline support is on' : 'Offline support turns on after the next page load');
      if (s.worker) row(s.worker.pages > 0, s.worker.pages > 0 ? `${s.worker.pages} pages saved for offline` : 'No pages saved yet');
      if (s.worker) row(s.worker.data > 0, s.worker.data > 0 && s.worker.newestDataAt ? `Saved job and follow-up data from ${formatAge(s.worker.newestDataAt)}` : 'No job or follow-up data saved yet');
      if (s.standalone) row(s.persisted, s.persisted ? 'Phone storage is protected from automatic cleanup' : s.persisted === false ? 'Phone storage may be cleaned up when space is low' : 'Storage protection unknown');
      // Updates arrive by themselves (see .ai/references/internal-pwa.md); this shows which build is running.
      const behind = s.workerBuild && s.workerBuild !== s.pageBuild;
      row(s.workerBuild ? !behind : null, s.workerBuild ? (behind ? `Version ${buildLabel(s.pageBuild)} on screen; ${buildLabel(s.workerBuild)} is installed. Reload to switch` : `Version ${buildLabel(s.pageBuild)} (updates install by themselves)`) : `Version ${buildLabel(s.pageBuild)}`);
      const pl = photoBackupLine(await getPhotoBackup());
      row(pl.ok, pl.text);
      row(s.online, s.online ? 'Browser reports a network connection' : 'Offline right now');
      list.innerHTML = rows.join('');
      install.hidden = !s.canInstall;
      const showIos = s.ios && !s.standalone;
      ios.hidden = !showIos;
      if (showIos) {
        const n = await countStoredPhotos();
        photoCount.textContent = n > 0 ? `This browser currently holds ${n} job photo${n === 1 ? '' : 's'}; keep using Safari for those until they are backed up.` : '';
      }
    }

    install.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const outcome = await promptInstall();
      note.textContent = outcome === 'accepted' ? 'Installing…' : outcome === 'dismissed' ? 'Install cancelled.' : 'This browser did not offer an install prompt. Use its menu: Add to Home screen.';
      render();
    });
    refresh.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      refresh.disabled = true; note.textContent = 'Saving pages…';
      const r = await warmPages();
      note.textContent = !r ? 'Offline support is not running yet. Reload this page and try again.' : r.signedOut ? 'Signed out. Sign in, then try again.' : r.ok ? `Saved ${r.saved} pages for offline use.` : `Saved ${r.saved ?? 0} pages; ${r.failed?.length ?? 0} could not be saved. Check your connection and try again.`;
      refresh.disabled = false; render();
    });
    update.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      update.disabled = true; note.textContent = 'Checking for a new version…';
      const r = await checkForUpdate();
      await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 1500)); // let a new worker finish installing
      const s = await getPwaStatus();
      note.textContent = r === 'unsupported' ? 'Offline support is not running, so there is nothing to update. Reload and try again.' : s.workerBuild && s.workerBuild !== s.pageBuild ? 'A newer version is installed. Reload this page to use it.' : `You have the latest version (${buildLabel(s.pageBuild)}).`;
      update.disabled = false; render();
    });
    diag.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      diag.disabled = true; note.textContent = 'Collecting…';
      const text = await buildDiagnostics();
      let copied = false;
      try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); copied = true; } catch { /* fall through to the older route */ }
      if (!copied) {
        diagText.hidden = false; diagText.value = text; diagText.focus(); diagText.select();
        try { copied = document.execCommand('copy'); } catch { /* leave the text on screen to copy by hand */ }
      }
      note.textContent = copied ? 'Diagnostics copied. Paste them into a message; they hold versions, counts and event names, no customer data.' : 'Select the text below and copy it, then paste it into a message.';
      diag.disabled = false;
    });
    clear.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!window.confirm('Clear saved pages and data from this phone? Job photos are not affected. They come back the next time you are online.')) return;
      const ok = await clearSavedData('all');
      note.textContent = ok ? 'Saved pages and data cleared. Job photos on this phone were not touched.' : 'Offline support is not running, so there was nothing to clear.';
      render();
    });
    onPwaChange(render);
    render();
  }
  initAppCard();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initAppCard);
</script>
<script>
  function initMailDiagnostics(){
    const sendButton=document.querySelector('[data-mail-test]'),checkButton=document.querySelector('[data-mail-check]'),status=document.querySelector('[data-mail-status]'),results=document.querySelector('[data-mail-results]'),sends=document.querySelector('[data-mail-sends]'),domains=document.querySelector('[data-mail-domains]');
    if(!(sendButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement)||!(checkButton instanceof HTMLButtonElement)||!(status instanceof HTMLElement)||!(results instanceof HTMLElement)||!(sends instanceof HTMLElement)||!(domains instanceof HTMLElement)||sendButton.dataset.bound==='true')return;sendButton.dataset.bound='true';
    const esc=(v)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.textContent=String(v??'');return d.innerHTML;};
    function render(data){results.hidden=false;const emailRows=Array.isArray(data.emails)?data.emails:[];sends.innerHTML=emailRows.length?emailRows.map((email)=>`<div class="mail-row"><div><strong>${esc(email.subject||'Untitled')}</strong><small>${esc(email.created_at||'')} · ${esc(email.last_event||'no event reported')}</small></div><code>${esc(email.id||'')}</code></div>`).join(''):'<p class="mail-empty">No recent sent email records returned by Resend.</p>';const domainRows=Array.isArray(data.domains)?data.domains:[];domains.innerHTML=domainRows.length?domainRows.map((domain)=>`<div class="mail-row"><div><strong>${esc(domain.name||'Unnamed domain')}</strong><small>${esc(domain.region||'')}</small></div><span class="mail-domain-state">${esc(domain.status||'unknown')}</span></div>`).join(''):'<p class="mail-empty">No sending domains returned by Resend.</p>';}
    async function check(){checkButton.disabled=true;checkButton.textContent='Checking…';status.textContent='Reading Resend activity…';try{const response=await fetch('/internal/api/mail-test',{headers:{'cache-control':'no-cache'}});const data=await response.json().catch(()=>({}));if(!response.ok||!data.ok)throw new Error(data.error||`Resend activity check failed (${response.status}).`);render(data);status.textContent=`Resend activity checked · HTTP ${data.emailsStatus}/${data.domainsStatus}`;}catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Resend activity check failed.';}finally{checkButton.disabled=false;checkButton.textContent='Check Resend activity';}}
    sendButton.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(!window.confirm('Send one controlled production test through the same Resend configuration as the live estimate form?'))return;sendButton.disabled=true;checkButton.disabled=true;sendButton.textContent='Sending…';status.textContent='Contacting Resend…';try{const response=await fetch('/internal/api/mail-test',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:'{}'});const data=await response.json().catch(()=>({}));if(!response.ok||!data.ok)throw new Error(`${data.error||'Resend rejected the production mail test.'} (HTTP ${data.resendStatus||response.status})`);status.textContent=`Accepted by Resend · HTTP ${data.resendStatus}${data.messageId?` · ${data.messageId}`:''}`;await check();}catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Production mail test failed.';}finally{sendButton.disabled=false;checkButton.disabled=false;sendButton.textContent='Send production test';}});checkButton.addEventListener('click',check);
  }
  initMailDiagnostics();document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',initMailDiagnostics);
</script>
<style>
.tools-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:var(--space-m);margin-bottom:var(--space-l)}.mail-test{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(19rem,.9fr);gap:var(--space-l);padding:var(--space-m);margin-bottom:var(--space-l);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 30%,var(--line));background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--paper-raised),var(--accent-wash))}.mail-test h2{margin:.15rem 0 .35rem;font-size:var(--step-2)}.mail-test p:not(.kicker){margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:54ch}.mail-test-action{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:.65rem}.mail-test-buttons{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.mail-test-buttons .btn{min-height:2.75rem}.mail-test-status{font-size:var(--step--2);color:var(--ink-soft);word-break:break-word}.mail-test-results{grid-column:1/-1;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:var(--space-s);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--space-l)}.mail-result-block{min-width:0}:global(.mail-row){display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--space-m);align-items:start;padding:.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}:global(.mail-row:last-child){border-bottom:0}:global(.mail-row strong),:global(.mail-row small){display:block}:global(.mail-row small){margin-top:.15rem;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--2)}:global(.mail-row code){font-size:.68rem;color:var(--ink-faint);word-break:break-all;text-align:right}:global(.mail-domain-state){font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}:global(.mail-empty){font-size:var(--step--2);color:var(--ink-soft)}.tool-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--space-s)}.tool-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:var(--space-s);padding:var(--space-m);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--paper-raised);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;min-height:13rem;transition:transform 120ms ease,box-shadow 120ms ease,border-color 120ms ease}.tool-card:hover,.tool-card:focus-visible{border-color:var(--line-strong);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);outline:none}.tool-primary{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 40%,var(--line))}.visualizer-card,.field-mode-card{border-color:var(--accent)}.tool-icon{width:2.4rem;height:2.4rem;border-radius:.8rem;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--ink);color:var(--on-dark);font-weight:800}.tool-primary .tool-icon{background:var(--accent)}.tool-card h2{margin:.15rem 0 .35rem;font-size:var(--step-1)}.tool-card p:not(.kicker){margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:42rem}.tool-arrow{grid-column:2;align-self:end;font-size:var(--step--1);font-weight:700}.roadmap{margin-top:var(--space-l);padding:var(--space-m)}.roadmap h2{margin:.15rem 0 .35rem;font-size:var(--step-1)}.roadmap-flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-top:var(--space-m)}.roadmap-flow span{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.45rem .7rem;font-size:var(--step--2);font-weight:700;background:var(--paper)}.roadmap-flow i{color:var(--ink-faint);font-style:normal}@media(max-width:800px){.mail-test{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mail-test-results{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mail-test-buttons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}.mail-test-buttons .btn{width:100%}}@media(max-width:700px){.tools-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.tool-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}:global(.mail-row){gap:.75rem;flex-direction:column}:global(.mail-row code){display:block;text-align:left}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.tool-card{transition:none}}

  .app-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:var(--space-m);margin-bottom:var(--space-m)}.app-copy h2{margin:.08rem 0 .4rem}.app-copy p{margin:.4rem 0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}.app-limits strong{color:var(--ink)}
  .app-status{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .75rem;padding:0;display:grid;gap:.3rem;font-size:var(--step--1)}.app-status :global(li){padding-left:1.4rem;position:relative}.app-status :global(li)::before{content:"•";position:absolute;left:.3rem;color:var(--ink-faint)}.app-status :global(li[data-state="ok"])::before{content:"✓";color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:800}.app-status :global(li[data-state="no"])::before{content:"–";color:var(--danger);font-weight:800}
  .app-ios{margin:0 0 .75rem;padding:.7rem .8rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--paper-sunk);font-size:var(--step--1)}.app-ios[hidden],.app-actions button[hidden]{display:none}
  .app-diag{width:100%;margin-top:.6rem;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:.6rem;background:var(--paper)}.app-diag[hidden]{display:none}
  .app-actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.app-note{margin:.6rem 0 0;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:var(--step--2);min-height:1.2em}
  @media(max-width:820px){.app-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
